      "title": "Voice change: your words in another voice with Chatterbox",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Voice change: your words in another voice with Chatterbox\n\nSays the words of your recording in the voice of a second recording. It reads the first 30 seconds of your recording. Built from Comfy's template audio-chatterbox_vc.\n\n## Models\n\n- [s3gen.pt](https://huggingface.co/ResembleAI/chatterbox/resolve/5bb1f6ee58e50c3b8d408bc82a6d3740c2db6e18/s3gen.pt): Chatterbox, by Resemble AI, [MIT](https://huggingface.co/ResembleAI/chatterbox).\n- [conds.pt](https://huggingface.co/ResembleAI/chatterbox/resolve/5bb1f6ee58e50c3b8d408bc82a6d3740c2db6e18/conds.pt): Chatterbox, by Resemble AI, [MIT](https://huggingface.co/ResembleAI/chatterbox).\n\nThe voice node has no model loader. The node pack downloads both files into models/chatterbox/chatterbox_vc on its first run.\n\n## Custom nodes\n\n- [ComfyUI_Fill-ChatterBox](https://github.com/filliptm/ComfyUI_Fill-ChatterBox) at commit f7d7a16187430abcaf91a3039b9c83aa9960816a, MIT."
      ],
